      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It\u2019s often hard to admit to yourself that you\u2019ve actually done
    something really great. Especially when you\u2019ve been led to believe that
    success is out of reach and that you need to be like everyone else\u2014not get
    your head in the clouds.\nIt\u2019s hard to achieve anything when you\u2019re
    constantly bombarded with an ideal that you\u2019re almost expected to worship.\nYou
    just need to keep that light burning inside you\u2014even if it\u2019s a secret\u2014and
    do everything you can to keep it from going out. Let them never find out about
    it. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
